{"id":"n16487-1-7","stage":2,"title":"썰렁하다 · 冷","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16487-1-7-1","ko":"밤이 되니까 썰렁하네.","zh":"一到晚上就有点冷了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"밤이","meaning":"夜，夜间","explanation":"밤：夜，夜间；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"밤","audio":"/audio/da9e530428ce1c2deaf3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74178","senseId":"1","lemma":"밤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밤이","audio":"/audio/23a201ad32980625a5be.mp3"}},{"text":"되니까","meaning":"到","explanation":"되다：到；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"3","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되니까","audio":"/audio/2922a00a6812e294540c.mp3"}},{"text":"썰렁하네.","meaning":"冷，凉","explanation":"썰렁하다：冷，凉；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"썰렁하다","audio":"/audio/76496cd6072147731c97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16487","senseId":"1","lemma":"썰렁하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"썰렁하네","audio":"/audio/868abc3d220091cd48f6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da9e530428ce1c2d","term":"밤","zh":"夜，夜间","audio":"/audio/da9e530428ce1c2deaf3.mp3","entryId":"74178","definition":"日落到第二天日出前的黑暗时段。","pronunciation":["밤"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"到","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"到达某个时间、时期或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"76496cd607214773","term":"썰렁하다","zh":"冷，凉","audio":"/audio/76496cd6072147731c97.mp3","entryId":"16487","definition":"阴凉或冰冷。","pronunciation":["썰렁하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5f9027ffd02c61369647.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16487-1-7-2","ko":"이제 곧 겨울이니까요.","zh":"毕竟快到冬天了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在。","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}},{"text":"곧","meaning":"就，马上，即将","explanation":"곧：就，马上，即将。","readings":[{"term":"곧","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26802","senseId":"2","lemma":"곧","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"곧","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3"}},{"text":"겨울이니까요.","meaning":"冬天，冬季","explanation":"겨울：冬天，冬季；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；니까요：在句末礼貌地解释原因或依据。","readings":[{"term":"겨울","audio":"/audio/ac9e69428d653c8c2b15.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64367","senseId":"1","lemma":"겨울","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"겨울이니까요","audio":"/audio/612b703a0c8e4a12a2d4.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"当下的时期。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"c2f53c24d7797085","term":"곧","zh":"就，马上，即将","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3","entryId":"26802","definition":"时间没过多久。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"ac9e69428d653c8c","term":"겨울","zh":"冬天，冬季","audio":"/audio/ac9e69428d653c8c2b15.mp3","entryId":"64367","definition":"四季中的一个，介于秋天和春天之间的寒冷的季节。","pronunciation":["겨울"]}],"audio":"/audio/849dadcdbe4affe18fea.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.437,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=16487","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":61,"sequenceScore":1.2637,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["毕竟快到冬天了。","一到晚上就有点冷了。","裕敏，你第几个考音乐？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["一到晚上就有点冷了。","裕敏，你第几个考音乐？","毕竟快到冬天了。"],"answer":2}]}
